description:
There is only one more control flow type: switch. Switch is just like a ton of else if (thing == value) in a row. The syntax is:
```ts
switch(variable) {
    case value:
        code;
        break;
    case value2:
        code;
        break;....
    default:
        code;
        break;
}
```
In this code, if variable = value then case 1 would run, if value 2, it would be case 2, and otherwise it wolud be default.
---
## Assignment:
MeTube categorizes videos by genre code. Given a genre code, print the genre name:
- `1` -> `Music`
- `2` -> `Gaming`
- `3` -> `Education`
- anything else -> `Unknown`
